    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Mullery O’Gara are pleased to present No. 3 Highfield Manor to the market. This superb two-bedroom apartment, quietly positioned within an attractive, secure gated development in the heart of Rathgar. \r\n\r\nBright, spacious and exceptionally well laid out, the apartment has a wonderful sense of space throughout. At its heart is a generous living and dining area, filled with natural light and providing an inviting space to relax, dine and entertain. A modern kitchen sits just off the main living space, while two well-proportioned bedrooms and a generous bathroom complete the accommodation. The property also benefits from a C-rated BER, secure electric gates and a designated parking space, creating an ideal combination of comfort, privacy and low-maintenance living in one of Dublin 6’s most sought-after neighbourhoods.\r\n\r\nThe location is difficult to beat. Rathgar Village is just a short stroll away, putting an excellent collection of cafés, restaurants and local shops practically on the doorstep, including Bijou Bistro & Deli and The Rathgar. Terenure, Rathmines and Ranelagh are also within easy reach, opening up an even greater choice of restaurants, cafés, shops and leisure amenities, including Swan Leisure. For those who enjoy the outdoors, Palmerston Park, Herzog Park and Bushy Park are all nearby, with Bushy Park offering beautiful walks along the Dodder together with tennis and padel courts, playing pitches, a playground, skatepark and duck pond.\r\n\r\nExcellent transport links make the location even more appealing. The S4 stops virtually on the doorstep, while the 14, 15, 15A, 15B, 15D, 65 and 65B are all available nearby, providing convenient connections across Dublin and into the city centre. Cowper Luas Stop on the Green Line is also within walking distance, offering easy access to the city, Dundrum and beyond. With Rathgar Village on your doorstep, excellent transport links, secure parking and everything from parks and cafés to shops and sporting facilities close at hand, No. 3 Highfield Manor offers an enviable Dublin 6 lifestyle in an exceptionally convenient setting."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Living Room - 4.12m x 1.62m\r\nDining Area - 4.01m x 1.47m\r\nKitchen - 2.22m x 3.28m\r\nBedroom 1 - 4.32m x 2.43m\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.61m x 2.61m\r\nBathroom - 2.64m x 1.62m"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Secure gated development with electric entrance gates \r\nOne designated parking space \r\nBright living and dining accommodation \r\nTwo well-proportioned bedrooms \r\nExcellent location close to Rathgar Village \r\nPalmerston Park, Herzog Park and Bushy Park nearby \r\nExcellent bus services and access to the Luas Green Line \r\n\r\nLocal area\r\nBus routes (within 10 mins): S4, 14, 15, 15A, 15B, 15D, 65 and 65B\r\nLuas: Cowper Stop c. 20-minutes by foot\r\n\r\nProperty features\r\nc. 51 sq. m. (548 sq. ft.)\r\nElectric heating\r\nC – BER rating\r\nDesignated parking\r\nManagement fees: c. €2,800 per annum\r\nYear of construction: 1995"
